# Claude Code
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/tmp/
# Parallel sessions started with `claude --worktree <name>` (rule 21).
.claude/worktrees/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Plan scratch: the planner writes `<slug>-plan.md` here and /project:work
# deletes it when the cycle ends. Only that name matches — a suffixed one
# (`auth-plan-v2.md`) shows up as untracked and fails the clean-tree check.
.handoff/*-plan.md
# Handoff scratch: the dispatch-handoff skill writes `<slug>-<role>-handoff.md`
# and the role's `<slug>-<role>-report.md`, and deletes both once the result
# is decided. The same rule: only these names match.
.handoff/*-handoff.md
.handoff/*-report.md

# Obsidian per-user vault config
docs/.obsidian/
